    "/api/v1/runs/{run_id}/stream": {
      "post": {
        "description": "The run's AG-UI events as SSE (ADR 0012), from `Last-Event-ID` (or `?after=`) on. Any request body is ignored.\n\nA disconnect ends only this generator: the run goes on, and a reconnect replays from its last `seq`.",
